{"about_the_game":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This grid puzzle game is perfect for relaxing during your leisure time. The gameplay is simple and intuitive: move the puzzle pieces based on the reference image on the right, and try to restore it to the complete picture. Each level presents a challenge, but it never feels overwhelming because there is no time limit, allowing you to enjoy the puzzle at a leisurely pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game unlocks 30 levels right from the start, and the gradually increasing difficulty along with ever-changing image styles ensure that every time you play, you feel a fresh sense of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With its beautiful interface design and smooth gameplay experience, this game is the ideal choice to unwind and pass the time. Give it a try!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630970?t=1744864964","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3630970?t=1744864964","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630970/078177c17b8a4dc2a2a0a639a46e32ac168f09b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744864964","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3630970/078177c17b8a4dc2a2a0a639a46e32ac168f09b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744864964","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This grid puzzle game is perfect for relaxing during your leisure time. The gameplay is simple and intuitive: move the puzzle pieces based on the reference image on the right, and try to restore it to the complete picture. Each level presents a challenge, but it never feels overwhelming because there is no time limit, allowing you to enjoy the puzzle at a leisurel